        + table([T('Khí', 'Gas'), 'k', 'T*/T₀', 'P*/P₀', 'ρ*/ρ₀'], [[T('không khí', 'air'), '1,4' if vi else '1.4', dec(crit(1.4)['TT'], 4), dec(crit(1.4)['PP'], 4), dec(crit(1.4)['rr'], 4)], [T('CO₂ (slide tr.37)', 'CO₂ (slide p.37)'), '1,289' if vi else '1.289', dec(cc['TT'], 4), dec(cc['PP'], 4), dec(cc['rr'], 4)], [T('sản phẩm cháy (tr.16)', 'combustion products (p.16)'), '1,33' if vi else '1.33', dec(crit(1.33)['TT'], 4), dec(crit(1.33)['PP'], 4), dec(crit(1.33)['rr'], 4)]])
